    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d485-f1" n="1" xml:id="d485-f1-content">
                <p>At its 69th meeting on October 12, 1950, the National Security Council, on the
                    recommendation of the NSC Senior Staff, agreed to cancel this project (NSC
